# ConsumeView architecture

## Domain (Rust, pure) — `src-tauri/src/domain/`

- Model prefix routing (`grok-*` → xAI, `gemini-*` → Google OpenAI-compatible)
- Cost calculation from `pricing.json`
- Aggregates (today / week / month), TTFT, tok/s, month-end cost projection
- **No** network, filesystem, keyring, or UI I/O

## Infra (Rust) — `proxy/`, `db/`, `secrets/`

- Axum proxy bound to `127.0.0.1:4000` only
- SSE stream tap, rusqlite WAL `metrics.db`, OS keyring, Tauri `token-logged` events

## UI (React) — `src/`

- Presentation and user intentions only (session switch, paste keys, period filters)
- **No** pricing formulas or routing logic in the frontend — call Tauri commands

## User rules

- Real API keys never leave the local app (never to Cursor)
- Proxy listens on localhost only
- Active session must be explicit
- Closing the window minimizes to tray by default while the proxy keeps running
